From: lyq1996 <lyq123233@163.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: rtw89: 8852c: add access point firmware support

Add the access point firmware variant, AP PLE/HFC quota overrides,
shared XTAL and AP PCIe power-off handling, eFEM gain handling, RFE GPIO
routing, and per-RFE parameter and TX power tables for RTL8852C.

Signed-off-by: lyq1996 <lyq123233@163.com>
---
